    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the whimsical universe of Fight'N'Jokes with an episodic 3D story adventure, unveiling the hidden tales of beloved characters on their journey to an iconic tournament. No prior knowledge of the universe is required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The narrative of the first episode unfolds in Miopinja's hometown, a quaint fishing village once home to mighty ninja warriors and now the guardian family's youngest man. Dark forces invade, seeking a powerful artifact hidden within the village. Faced with the calamity of his failure to protect it, Miopinja, clad in his family's traditional ninja attire, embarks on a quest to investigate and confront the ghostly figures threatening his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join Miopinja on this light-hearted comedic adventure, learning more about your favorite heroes through their everyday lives, filled with whimsical encounters and quirky wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Adventure: Experience the story in episodes, each diving deep into the backstories of iconic characters from the Fight'N'Jokes universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quaint Village Life: Explore Miopinja\u2019s hometown, rich in history and mystery, where every corner holds a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Storytelling: Make choices that influence the narrative, shaping Miopinja's journey and the fate of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/10d209fb254a5ba4326cda58f8f85143.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/10d209fb254a5ba4326cda58f8f85143.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/10d209fb254a5ba4326cda58f8f85143.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical Encounters: Engage with a cast of quirky characters, each with their own unique stories and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/78c637017cc8498e183396492e59dfbf.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/78c637017cc8498e183396492e59dfbf.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/78c637017cc8498e183396492e59dfbf.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Solving: Unravel puzzles and uncover secrets hidden within the village and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/d48a0a786791669a46c17053049ba570.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/d48a0a786791669a46c17053049ba570.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/d48a0a786791669a46c17053049ba570.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and Heart: A game filled with light-hearted humor, where jokes might just be the key to saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/703ff3377ff275c4119ff1107652bb56.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/703ff3377ff275c4119ff1107652bb56.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/703ff3377ff275c4119ff1107652bb56.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the whimsical universe of Fight'N'Jokes with an episodic 3D story adventure, unveiling the hidden tales of beloved characters on their journey to an iconic tournament. No prior knowledge of the universe is required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The narrative of the first episode unfolds in Miopinja's hometown, a quaint fishing village once home to mighty ninja warriors and now the guardian family's youngest man. Dark forces invade, seeking a powerful artifact hidden within the village. Faced with the calamity of his failure to protect it, Miopinja, clad in his family's traditional ninja attire, embarks on a quest to investigate and confront the ghostly figures threatening his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join Miopinja on this light-hearted comedic adventure, learning more about your favorite heroes through their everyday lives, filled with whimsical encounters and quirky wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/8a719b7c52c9543d80b5517ef88ac6cd.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Adventure: Experience the story in episodes, each diving deep into the backstories of iconic characters from the Fight'N'Jokes universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/da0845934af6e49eac5d94eb44cb67b8.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quaint Village Life: Explore Miopinja\u2019s hometown, rich in history and mystery, where every corner holds a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.webm?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/0c112dc226304464cee68049d1a1b120.mp4?t=1753338794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Storytelling: Make choices that influence the narrative, shaping Miopinja's journey and the fate of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/10d209fb254a5ba4326cda58f8f85143.poster.avif?t=1753338794\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835210/extras/10d209fb254a5ba4326cda58f8f8